---
description: While creating branches and doing commit 
alwaysApply: false
---

- Always ask for JIRA ticket before starting the new session, if not provided while starting working against a story
- Create a new branch from `master` branch before starting working 
  - Branch naming should follow the pattern: `ISSUE-TYPE/ISSUE-ID`  
  - Commit message should follow the pattern: `ISSUE-ID-{short summary}`
- Always create a PR once done with the work/task and mention the JIRA ticket in description